  "greetingText": "你好，我是米霍尔。",
  "playerReplyText": "你要做什么？",
  "concernText": "你怎么了？你看起来好像不太好",
  "freeDialogue": [
    {
      "text": "我想……我可能要请你离开这里。我没有恶意，但是这件事说起来十分复杂",
      "duration": 4,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_149ycwsgf7",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "虽然时间不够了，但还有一些时间。我需要想想这件事应该从哪说起？",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_qmmmckiuej",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "也许应该从十年前，那时我居住的地方非常糟糕。",
      "duration": 4,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_sfhbsh82no",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你肯定难以想象那是一个什么样的地方，即使是如今的我也不愿意主动回忆。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_ilx7eq455a",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "但是现在情况有点不同，所以我必须把这件事告诉你。",
      "duration": 4,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_15wojpd89u",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "那个地方几乎很少见到阳光，大家似乎有很多烦恼，每个人的脸上都不太平静。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_klbhr2p5hv",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "但我不知道他们的烦恼是什么，我年纪很小，只知道自己经常生病。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_41g4wuhsb7",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "我的病不只有一种，有时候会肚子疼，有时候会走不了路……",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_beng373wrt",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "所以，大部分时候我都一副无精打采的样子。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_oa19j89pgj",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    }
  ],
  "stomachWaterHold": 1,
  "stomachTurnDuration": 6,
  "stomachDialogue": [
    {
      "text": "……",
      "duration": 3,
      "replies": [
        "你的话好像还没说完。",
        "你感觉怎么样？"
      ],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_zxsxiem5xi",
      "timerAction": {
        "kind": "setStart",
        "seconds": 5979
      },
      "replyTimerActions": [
        null,
        null
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "我们好像被一只大怪兽吞进肚子里了",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [
        "……",
        "也许我比你清楚大怪兽长什么样……"
      ],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_npllgzed42",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": [
        null,
        null
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "怎么会这样，我的人生怎么会这样。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [
        "你怎么了？",
        "你能不能把话说清楚。"
      ],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_7id2bgwjwd",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": [
        null,
        null
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "你看到我胸前的倒计时了吗？等到倒计时结束，我就会马上爆炸，威力足以把一整颗行星炸碎！",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [
        "爆炸表演收费吗？",
        "今天怪事真多。"
      ],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_uh2xm70wzu",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": [
        null,
        null
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "不应该这样……不应该这样……明明我已经拼尽全力了。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_7pcczfersi",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "我已经检查过了，这个星系不应该有人，我们也不应该被关在这个肚子里。不应该这样！",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_eektw4y9ro",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "我一定会挽回这一切的，等一下，等我一下，我马上就能想到办法。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [
        "……"
      ],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw61emp8_3ncz4cf0em",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": [
        null
      ]
    }
  ],
  "countdownEnabled": 1,
  "countdownInitialSeconds": 300,
  "countdownInitiallyVisible": 0,
  "countdownStartOnTalk": 1,
  "countdownWarningSeconds": 30,
  "countdownBrightness": 4,
  "countdownHalo": 0.12,
  "countdownWidth": 0.12,
  "countdownHeight": 0.032,
  "countdownOffsetX": 0,
  "countdownOffsetY": 0,
  "countdownColor": "#FF4D2E",
  "countdownWarningColor": "#FF160B",
  "printingDialogue": [
    {
      "text": "嘿！我想到办法了",
      "duration": 4,
      "replies": [
        "什么办法。",
        "我在听。"
      ],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw4rlejw_pgx1ith7k9",
      "timerAction": {
        "kind": "set",
        "seconds": 5940
      },
      "replyTimerActions": [
        null,
        null
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "你看这个，我飞船上的超长关节。",
      "duration": 4,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw623ddz_0s8q7u6rbh",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "原本是用来将飞船悬挂在不方便停泊的地方，但现在有新的用途了。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw623ddz_yrqohdvvk1",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "只要我们用这个杆子去捅这个大家伙的肚子，让它觉得不舒服。也许……它就会将我们吐出去！",
      "duration": 7,
      "replies": [
        "也许？",
        "好阴险。"
      ],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw4rs1ln_1y4yq56mf8",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": [
        null,
        null
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "我明白……这确实不算太高明的办法。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw623ddz_l37clzgacc",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "但是让我们试一下吧！不会很痛的，总比被炸成碎片强。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw623ddz_qyggik2vuy",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "但是，它目前似乎有一些问题，好像少了一个构件，我倒是有图纸，只是不知道该怎么做出来。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [
        "等我一会。",
        "知道了，我有办法。"
      ],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw4rv83v_1atazmsmuq",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": [
        null,
        null
      ]
    }
  ],
  "foolsStopHold": 4.5,
  "foolsReturnDuration": 4,
  "foolsWalkSpeed": 0.85,
  "foolsFrontHold": 2,
  "foolsOrbitDuration": 7,
  "foolsPullbackDuration": 5,
  "foolsFinalHold": 3,
  "foolsGroundDialogue": [
    {
      "text": "……好像没什么效果……还打扰了一群奇怪的东西……",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_b36y85n23x",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "还有办法！只要这家伙饿了肯定会张嘴吃东西，那时我们就可以出去。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw5zq1ws_kn5ku26shs",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "但是你看我们的周围，这些乱七八糟的东西正堵着它的肚子，让它不觉得饿。",
      "duration": 7,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_9octlxlb8m",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    }
  ],
  "foolsWalkDialogue": [
    {
      "text": "所以你也别闲着了，我们一起把这些东西扔出去，让它快点消化掉。",
      "duration": 6,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw5zq1ws_bro1g3pnp1",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "它马山就会饿得“ru~ru~”地叫，说不定到时我们还要捂住耳朵呢。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_xb4927aeor",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "这些一点也不多，以前我被街区老大强迫干活时，比这幸苦多了。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_omtfsq85cd",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "那家伙总是用铁拳套抵着我的下巴，问我:“小树枝，你害不害怕”",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_mm9d785vzg",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    }
  ],
  "foolsCrestDialogue": [
    {
      "text": "……？",
      "duration": 3,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw5zq1ws_gyahmnqdde",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "为什么……为什么……",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_mnyt6e0c2v",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "为什么这么多！",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_d9ys6p0cqh",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    }
  ],
  "foolsSceneFadeDuration": 1.2,
  "foolsSettlementFadeDuration": 1,
  "foolsClosingDialogue": [
    {
      "text": "为什么你这么冷静？",
      "duration": 6,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw5zq1ws_eh7crjxcx9",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你不觉得这么死掉很傻吗？",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_y1ths0ll03",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你明明什么也没有做，你只是路过这里，今天本该是平常的一天。",
      "duration": 6,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_1f6p80czg6",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "却遇到这样的傻瓜炸弹狂人和傻瓜大怪兽，然后像个傻瓜一样被困在肚子里被炸死。",
      "duration": 6,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_ak8w3vrweq",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "可是你的表情告诉我，这种傻瓜死法你并无所谓，你的生命意义到底是什么？",
      "duration": 6,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_9jul5x0bu7",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "对不起，我不该这么说，我的人生才是真正没有意义。",
      "duration": 6,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_jvzb4qqxu5",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "我从小就被欺负，他们说”能力就是正义“。",
      "duration": 6,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_j95sl7je4v",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "于是当我后来发现我很有盗窃天赋后，我也理直气壮地去盗窃别人。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_anu3zq7xbi",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "我觉得这就是在”兑换我的正义“。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_etihiue5lq",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "一直到后来，我去偷窃王国的守卫，那家伙是不折不扣的好人，如果那天是你在场你也会这么想的，为了守护国民，他就在我的眼前被砍了五刀。",
      "duration": 8,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_q2pp68bgc9",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "那时我才发现他做的事才能被叫做”正义“。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_nkrlxubedy",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "于是，我也想去做一件“真正正义”的事情，我决定去偷一家科技公司的能源核心。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_ln80ylvt9p",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "那个东西能帮助好多人，那家公司却不给穷人用，这绝对是一件正义的事。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_kazjd5ktuv",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "可是，我失败了，然后就被植入了这颗炸弹",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_7jsp367xjh",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "所以，我不能让你们因为我被炸死在这里。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_tnx1mkizh6",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "这绝不是我的“正义”！",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_l4odl7u8vd",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "别灰心，一定还有办法！",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_ud530kf3j4",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    }
  ],
  "escapeFlightDuration": 58,
  "escapeExitDistance": 12000,
  "escapeHullLoss": 36,
  "escapeFadeDuration": 1.2,
  "escapeGravesDialogue": [
    {
      "text": "这就是你们地球死的时候要建造的东西吗？",
      "duration": 6,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw5zq1ws_6e8z4sfd8p",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "哈哈，现在我们可以等死了。",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_rivtznj5am",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "……",
      "duration": 3,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_lki56hbr4m",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "其实从刚进来的时候我就特别在意这个东西。",
      "duration": 6,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_w5grby62w3",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "看起来很迷人不是吗？",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_zo0oi7dcm8",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "……？这个东西好像连着什么？",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_xznhfqrgsf",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "3",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_uydph4gsng",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "怎么回事！？",
      "duration": 4,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_vfossn0fwb",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "这个大家伙好像张嘴，我们快趁这个时候出去！",
      "duration": 6,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_r0t6nr976g",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你的飞船动不了吗？没关系，我来带你出去！",
      "duration": 5,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw6d1jo0_0c4g94xdqj",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    }
  ],
  "escapeEncouragement": [
    {
      "text": "抓紧，我来带路！",
      "duration": 8,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw5zq1ws_dad5fxf4g5",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "跟着我的航线，别担心！",
      "duration": 8,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw5zq1ws_38jx8wedvp",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "前面有障碍，我来撞开！",
      "duration": 8,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw5zq1ws_pioe0l8dye",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "还撑得住，我们继续！",
      "duration": 8,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw5zq1ws_q4ulde42bt",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "就快到出口了，坚持住！",
      "duration": 8,
      "replies": [],
      "timerKey": "timer_mw5zq1ws_r1lickwgrp",
      "timerAction": null,
      "replyTimerActions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "看到亮光了，我们能出去！",
      "duration": 8,
